(13402, 196, 766, 5, N'The tour exceeded all our expectations! The highlight was the boat cruise through the limestone caves - absolutely spectacular. The local cuisine was a genuine revelation. Five stars!', '2025-03-28 04:00:00', NULL, 0),
(13403, 98, 766, 3, N'Good memories made despite minor organizational hiccups. Our departure was delayed by about an hour which compressed the afternoon schedule. The boat trip was absolutely worth it.', '2026-07-02 04:00:00', NULL, 0),
(13404, 86, 766, 3, N'Fairly good experience. The cultural sites were fascinating but the journey between locations was very long and tiring. The guide was helpful but occasionally hard to hear in larger groups.', '2025-10-03 04:00:00', NULL, 0),
(13405, 229, 766, 2, N'Good memories made despite minor organizational hiccups. Our departure was delayed by about an hour which compressed the afternoon schedule. The boat trip was absolutely worth it.', '2026-03-18 04:00:00', NULL, 0),
