(13407, 171, 766, 4, N'Amazing value for money! The itinerary was well-planned with a perfect balance of sightseeing and relaxation. Our family had an unforgettable time. The hotel arrangements were excellent.', '2025-11-30 04:00:00', NULL, 0),
(13408, 507, 766, 4, N'Professionally organized with great attention to detail. The transport was comfortable and on time throughout. Our guide had wonderful humor and made everyone feel welcome. Superb trip!', '2025-11-27 04:00:00', NULL, 0),
(13409, 435, 766, 4, N'Professionally organized with great attention to detail. The transport was comfortable and on time throughout. Our guide had wonderful humor and made everyone feel welcome. Superb trip!', '2025-04-18 04:00:00', NULL, 0),
(13410, 173, 767, 2, N'The destination itself is truly beautiful. However the tour felt slightly overpriced for what was delivered. The food tour portion was excellent but shopping stops felt unnecessary.', '2025-06-24 04:00:00', NULL, 0),
(13411, 312, 767, 4, N'Absolutely fantastic tour! The guide was incredibly knowledgeable and passionate about local history. We learned so much and the scenery was breathtaking. Highly recommend to anyone visiting Vietnam!', '2025-04-14 04:00:00', NULL, 0),
(13412, 348, 767, 2, N'The scenery was gorgeous as advertised but the group was slightly larger than expected which slowed things down at popular viewpoints. Still worth doing, just manage your expectations.', '2026-03-16 04:00:00', NULL, 0),
(13413, 288, 767, 5, N'Absolutely fantastic tour! The guide was incredibly knowledgeable and passionate about local history. We learned so much and the scenery was breathtaking. Highly recommend to anyone visiting Vietnam!', '2026-01-04 04:00:00', NULL, 0),
(13414, 184, 767, 5, N'Absolutely fantastic tour! The guide was incredibly knowledgeable and passionate about local history. We learned so much and the scenery was breathtaking. Highly recommend to anyone visiting Vietnam!', '2025-03-20 04:00:00', NULL, 0),
(13415, 497, 767, 5, N'Outstanding tour from beginning to end! The cultural immersion was genuine and respectful. We participated in traditional cooking, village visits, and local ceremonies. Simply magical!', '2025-09-22 04:00:00', NULL, 0),
(13416, 97, 767, 2, N'Overall a decent tour with some highlights. The morning trek was genuinely beautiful but the afternoon felt a bit rushed. Food quality varied between stops. Decent value for the price though.', '2026-01-22 04:00:00', NULL, 0),
(13417, 105, 767, 5, N'The tour exceeded all our expectations! The highlight was the boat cruise through the limestone caves - absolutely spectacular. The local cuisine was a genuine revelation. Five stars!', '2026-02-07 04:00:00', NULL, 0),
(13418, 194, 767, 1, N'Not worth the premium price. The itinerary was padded with unnecessary shopping stops at commission-based stores. The actual heritage sites got only 20 minutes each. Very disappointing.', '2025-03-08 04:00:00', NULL, 0),
(13419, 259, 767, 1, N'Several issues throughout the trip. Transport was uncomfortable with broken air conditioning in summer heat. The local food arranged was poor quality. Communication was very lacking.', '2025-12-07 04:00:00', NULL, 0),
(13420, 318, 767, 2, N'Mixed experience overall. The main attractions were impressive but we felt the schedule was too tight for a proper lunch break. Guide was knowledgeable but spoke too fast at times.', '2025-07-27 04:00:00', NULL, 0),
(13421, 221, 767, 4, N'A truly world-class experience. The tour guide was friendly, professional, and went above and beyond to ensure everyone had a great time. The landscape photos came out beautifully!', '2025-08-01 04:00:00', NULL, 0),
(13422, 96, 767, 5, N'Incredible experience exploring Vietnam''s hidden gems! The guide shared fascinating stories about local legends and history. The food stops were consistently excellent. Will recommend to all friends!', '2026-07-15 04:00:00', NULL, 0),
(13423, 60, 767, 2, N'Good tour with some room for improvement. The cave exploration was the absolute highlight. Some hotels were better than others. The itinerary could use a bit more free time at each stop.', '2025-04-06 04:00:00', NULL, 0),
(13424, 70, 767, 3, N'The destination itself is truly beautiful. However the tour felt slightly overpriced for what was delivered. The food tour portion was excellent but shopping stops felt unnecessary.', '2025-09-20 04:00:00', NULL, 0),
(13425, 122, 767, 2, N'The tour guide was frequently on his phone and missed important information at several sites. The promised premium hotel was clearly budget quality. Requested refund was ignored.', '2026-07-04 04:00:00', NULL, 0);
